This package is an independent implementation of methods published in the
academic literature. Credit for the methods belongs to their authors:

  * Lettau, M. and Pelger, M. (2020). Estimating latent asset-pricing factors.
    Journal of Econometrics 218(1), 1-31.  (RP-PCA)
  * Lettau, M. and Pelger, M. (2020). Factors that fit the time series and
    cross-section of stock returns. Review of Financial Studies 33(5), 2274-2325.
  * Kelly, B., Pruitt, S. and Su, Y. (2019). Characteristics are covariances:
    A unified model of risk and return. Journal of Financial Economics 134(3),
    501-524.  (IPCA)
  * Giglio, S. and Xiu, D. (2021). Asset pricing with omitted factors.
    Journal of Political Economy 129(7), 1947-1990.  (three-pass estimator)
  * Giglio, S., Xiu, D. and Zhang, D. Test assets and weak factors.
    Journal of Finance.  (supervised PCA)
  * Bryzgalova, S., DeMiguel, V., Li, S. and Pelger, M. (2026). Asset-pricing
    factors with economic targets. Working paper.  (target PCA)
  * Onatski, A. (2010). Determining the number of factors from empirical
    distribution of eigenvalues. Review of Economics and Statistics 92(4).

The archived legacy IPCA code in archive/legacy/IPCA is a modified fork of
https://github.com/bkelly-lab/ipca (MIT License, Copyright (c) the IPCA
authors). The new implementation in src/ does not reuse that code.

